    "title": "Music Night Battle: Rap Battle",
    "description": "<b>Music Night Battle: Rap Battle is an night music game to feel digital music rhythm and rock the beat!<b> In Music Night Battle, you could press at digital arrows and make them exactly match as perfect as you can to get the highest score and climb to the top rank. \ud83c\udfb6\ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\nRap in cg5 music and beat all enemies from Indie cross where you have to use multiple skills to beat your opponents in funky night music battle. Up, Down, Left and Right, follow the rhythm, fight till the last minute, earn your respect and win the heart of others! Are you ready for a new challenge? \ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 <b>How to Enjoy Night Music Battle: <b>\r\n* Magic arrows go up follow digital rhythm. \r\n* Tap the note as it reaches scoring area to achieve the highest score.\r\n* Try to challenge harder songs.\r\n* Complete one level in story mode to unlock the next level\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc96 <b>Amazing music game Featured:<b>\r\n- Different difficulty makes more choice\r\n- Awesome graphics and amazing sound effects\r\n- High-quality backgrounds\r\n- Your favorite characters: Boyfriend, Girlfriend, Huggy Wuggy, Rainbow Friends, Duet Cats, Jambo Josh, Imposter , SpangeBob, etc\r\n- Catchy songs to boost up your Friday midnight mood\r\n\r\nBeat all Indie enemies from EXE world in digital music battles to feel the rhythm! Download Music Battle Night for FREE now and beat them all! Let the Music Night Battle go drive you insane!</b></b></b></b></b></b>",
